WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.139 --> 00:00:04.219
Welcome to the Sequencer Event Structures for Game Development

2
00:00:04.219 --> 00:00:07.660
course for Unreal Engine 5.5.

3
00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:10.039
This course is the second video in this series designed

4
00:00:10.039 --> 00:00:12.099
to provide you Sequencer-based workflows,

5
00:00:12.099 --> 00:00:16.379
specifically in building in-game cutscenes for video games.

6
00:00:16.379 --> 00:00:19.620
We'll recap game development principles, Sequencer concepts,

7
00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:22.839
features, and tools, then dive into creating Blueprint logic

8
00:00:22.839 --> 00:00:26.559
to control our in-game cutscenes, script player inputs,

9
00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:29.539
and lastly, trigger an event through an external actor.

10
00:00:29.539 --> 00:00:32.100
We'll also include some best practice recommendations

11
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.460
when using Sequencer for game development.

12
00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:38.740
For this course, you'll find the Sequence 205 Start Map located

13
00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:43.859
in your Content Browser under Courses, Sequence 205 Maps.
